  "evidencia": "Page: The Passion of the Christ. Sentence: The Passion of the Christ (also known simply as The Passion) is a 2004 American biblical drama film directed by Mel Gibson, written by Gibson and Benedict Fitzgerald, and starring Jim Caviezel as Jesus Christ, Maia Morgenstern as the Virgin Mary, and Monica Bellucci as Mary Magdalene.\nPage: Monica Bellucci. Sentence: She played the role of Persephone in the 2003 science-fiction films \"The Matrix Reloaded\" and \"The Matrix Revolutions,\" Mary Magdalene in the 2004 biblical drama \"The Passion of the Christ,\" Malèna Scordia in the 2000 film \"Malèna\" and Alex in the controversial art film \"Irréversible.\"",
