        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mel Gibson, Benedict Fitzgerald, Jim Caviezel, Maia Morgenstern, Monica Bellucci\n- Works: The Passion of the Christ, The Matrix Reloaded, The Matrix Revolutions, Malèna, Irréversible\n- Roles: Jesus Christ, Virgin Mary, Mary Magdalene, Persephone, Malèna Scordia, Alex\n- Topics: film casting, film credits\n\nFacts:\n- In 2000, Monica Bellucci played Malèna Scordia in the film \"Malèna.\"\n- In 2003, Monica Bellucci played Persephone in the science-fiction films \"The Matrix Reloaded\" and \"The Matrix Revolutions.\"\n- In 2004, \"The Passion of the Christ\" was released as an American biblical drama film.\n- In 2004, \"The Passion of the Christ\" was directed by Mel Gibson and written by Mel Gibson and Benedict Fitzgerald.\n- In 2004, Jim Caviezel starred in \"The Passion of the Christ\" as Jesus Christ, Maia Morgenstern starred as the Virgin Mary, and Monica Bellucci starred as Mary Magdalene.\n- Monica Bellucci also played Alex in the controversial art film \"Irréversible.\"",
